      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "• • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • Donating Agent Skills to the Agentic AI Foundation \\ Anthropic • • • • • •",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Skip to main content Today, we’re donating Agent Skills , the open standard that gives AI agents specialized knowledge and workflows, to the Agentic AI Foundation (AAIF).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "More than 70 agent platforms, including ChatGPT, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, and VS Code, have integrated Agent Skills since we published the standard in December 2025.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Agent interoperability through simplicity",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Within weeks of our October 2025 launch, developers published thousands of skills on GitHub and wrote loaders for Codex, Cursor, and OpenCode.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We then published Agent Skills as an open standard, under its own GitHub organization and domain, so any agent could use it.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "So far, 1 million skills have been published and nearly 280 million installed.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re committed to keeping Agent Skills open, community-driven, and vendor-neutral.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we are donating the standard to the Agentic AI Foundation (AAIF) under the Linux Foundation, which we co-founded with Block and OpenAI last year, and to which we donated the Model Context Protocol (MCP).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The AAIF will provide a neutral home to the standard going forward, ensuring the community has a say in where Agent Skills go next.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We are donating the Agent Skills name and logo, the GitHub organization, and the agentskills.io domain.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Thank you to the developers who built with Agent Skills from the start, and to the teams who brought skills into their products.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:22.180Z"
      }
    ],
